  "releaseNotes": "Resolve DNS and add connection guards:\n      - Replace the previous constructor delegation for DnsEndPoint with explicit initialization: construct base ClientServerTransport, set Address and Port, resolve the host via Dns.GetHostAddresses and assign an IPEndPoint.\n      - Expand Connect(DnsEndPoint) to prevent concurrent connect attempts (return if IsConnecting), handle existing connections by calling Disconnect and spin-waiting (up to 500 spins) until fully disconnected, then resolve the DNS to an IPEndPoint, set Address/Port, and call Connect().\n      - These changes ensure the endpoint is resolved before connecting and reduce race conditions during reconnects.",
